  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3007.04 Ratios",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3007.04 Ratios. The ratios provided in Env-A 3007.01, Env-A 3007.02, and Env-A 3007.03 are established solely for the purpose of transferring ERCs between Generator sources and user sources and do not modify, amend or supercede any offset requirements of the Act.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
